    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Mock data\n\nOne Set node holds the whole test catalog as raw JSON. Split Out turns that single item into five items.\n\nEdit the JSON here to change your test data, or pin the output of Split Into Items and edit items directly in the output panel.",
        "height": 260,
